  "invariants": [
    "Exactly three user-visible Processing states",
    "RESOLVE is a transition, not a fourth state",
    "No fake progress percentage or ETA",
    "Fish Focus appears only after a real fish location exists",
    "Photo remains visually dominant",
    "AI Edge Field keeps four Primary Energy Islands and mandatory Quiet Gaps",
